## 3. Methodology

This assessment followed a three-phase black-box/grey-box approach against the defined scope:

1. **Reconnaissance** — Network and service discovery using Nmap
2. **Traffic Analysis** — Live packet capture and protocol analysis using Wireshark
3. **Web Vulnerability Scanning** — Automated scanning of discovered web services using Nikto

All activity was conducted from a Kali Linux workstation within the assessment window stated in Section 1.

