**Severity definitions used:**

| Severity | Definition |
|---|---|
| Critical | Immediately exploitable, high impact — data breach, full compromise, or credential exposure in cleartext |
| High | Significant weakness, exploitable with moderate effort, serious potential impact |
| Medium | Weakness that increases risk but requires additional conditions/access to exploit |
| Low | Minor issue, limited impact on its own |
| Info | No direct risk, but worth noting (hardening opportunity, informational disclosure) |

